msgctxt "172"
msgid "Hoargh... Ghah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Looks like I won."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"How... in the hell... did you outrun me? You must've done some crazy "
"intensive training to pull that off..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Well, here's your prize money. 70 big ones... That's 70,000\r\n"
"yen, by my count. It's all there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "You got <Color:8>70,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Guess I still got a ways to go... But I'll get you next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "*pant* *pant*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Heh, I practically ran you over, just like the rest of 'em.\r\n"
"It was like a lion chasing down a gazelle⑬you didn't stand a chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Go put some hours on the treadmill or something.\r\n"
"You know where to find me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "*pant* *pant*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Hmph. Your legs aren't half-bad for a man your age.\r\n"
"But a loss is a loss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"I was expecting a lot more from the man who beat my brother.\r\n"
"Guess I got my hopes up for nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"I'll still be in town for a while, so brush up on your\r\n"
"sprinting and come back when you're ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "You again, huh? Hope you got more pep in your step than last time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Same deal as always: it's 5,000 yen up front, and if I can't catch you "
"while the timer's running, I'll pay you 70 grand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Well? How 'bout we get right to it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "So it's you... Hope you got some pep in your step."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"Here's the deal: 5,000 yen up front, and if I can't catch you while the "
"timer's running, I'll pay you 70 grand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "So who's the wise guy who managed to smack you in the chops?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Leave it alone, aniki. He's not such a bad guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"You just don't get it, do you? Get schooled even once in our\r\n"
"line of work, and it's all over for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "I can't just let you soil our profession like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Aniki... If you could just chill..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Oh! It's you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "So this is the guy who clocked you, huh? Eh... He don't look like much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "And you are?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"I'm his aniki. Y'know, like an older brother figure.\r\n"
"We got a real similar bit going on, see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "So you're another Mr. Try and Hit Me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Hah... Not quite. I'm in the running business, so they call\r\n"
"me... <Color:7>Mr. Try and Flee Me<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Mr. Try and Flee Me? Now I've heard everything..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"Damn straight. You haul ass, and I come chasin' after ya.\r\n"
"Ditch me successfully and I pay out the prize money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "That's an... interesting concept."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"Yeah, well. I'd trample you in a second if we were limited to this here "
"parking lot, so I expanded the course to the entirety of Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Sounds simple enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"Don't underestimate me, chump. I won the 800-meter back in\r\n"
"high school. That means I'm a certifiable racin' man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"Oh, and it'll cost you 5,000 yen up front. Outrun me till the timer's up, "
"and I'll pay you 70,000 yen in prize money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "So, how about it? Wanna give it a go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"(All I have to do is ditch him to get 70,000 yen?\r\n"
"Not a bad deal.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "All right, I'll take your challenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "That's what I like to hear! Now hand over that 5,000 and get ready to run."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Here you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "You paid out <Color:8>5,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"Okay... Looks like it's all here. Again, your job is to run\r\n"
"around the city while keepin' away from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid ""
"Do it long enough and I'll pay you that cool cash money.\r\n"
"And no slacking off, 'cause I'll catch ya in a heartbeat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "...Looks like I'm a little short."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "Hey, this ain't no damn charity! You think I chase after people for free!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Go scrape up 5 grand and come back. I'll be warming up right here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "All right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "Sorry. Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid ""
"What, you getting cold feet? Feeling nervous about being\r\n"
"chased around by an unfamiliar man in a brown jacket?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"...Pathetic. Come back when you decide to grow a pair!\r\n"
"...Of feet, that is. Feet that can outrun me. I'd like that."
msgstr ""

